# textdomain: doggiowars
# Odia translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=ଭାସମାନ ଭକ୍ସେଲ ଦ୍ୱୀପ ଉପରେ ଆକାଶ ଯୁଦ୍ଧ — ଆପଣ ହିଁ ଯୁଦ୍ଧବିମାନ। 12ଟି ଦ୍ୱୀପ ବାୟୋମ, ଆଗ୍ନେୟଗିରି ଓ ଜଳପ୍ରପାତ, ଆକାଶ କସରତ, ଧ୍ୱଂସଯୋଗ୍ୟ ଭୂଖଣ୍ଡ ଏବଂ ସୁନେଲି ଠେକୁଆ ପଛରେ ଗ୍ରେହାଉଣ୍ଡ ଦୌଡ଼। କିବୋର୍ଡ + ଗେମପ୍ୟାଡ।
